/	WTMU1 - WRITE OUT MENUS - PART 1
/
/ EDIT HISTORY
/ 001  KMD  02-sep-85  Move pp1 and ed1 from field 1 to 2 as 1 overflowed

	*200			/ START ADDRESS USED BY OS8 "GO" COMMAND
	JMP I	.+3		/ LOCATION USED TO START UP RXHAN
	JMP I	.+1		/ LOCATION USED TO RETURN TO OS8 MONITOR
	7605			/ ADDRESS OF OS8 MONITOR RETURN POINT
	RXLOAD			/ ADDRESS OF START LOCATION FOR RXHAN

	*RXLDLS			/ ADDRESS WITHIN RXHAN TO OVERLAY
	RXEWT			/ WRITE FUNCTION CODE
	0			/
	RXQBLK			/ ADDRESS OF QUEUE BLOCK TO USE
	WTMULS-1		/ ADDRESS OF TABLE OF DISK COMMANDS

	*3000			/ TABLE LOCATION IN FIELD ZERO

WTMULS,

